{%- comment -%}
  Bassface About page — the board is `Yo66c`, 1440 only.

  A DOCUMENT PAGE, not a listing: no imagery, no cards, no grid. Four numbered
  sections under one display statement, which is the whole composition. Anything
  added here that carries a picture is a different page.

  ASSIGNED BY HAND. `templates/page.about.json` exists but Shopify does not route
  a page to it automatically — the "About" template has to be picked on the page
  itself in the admin, under Online Store > Pages > About > Theme template.

  THE FIRST bf-main-* SECTION WITH BLOCKS. The three repeating runs — the four
  WHAT WE DO rows, the three support ways, the three contact details — are block
  types rather than numbered settings, so the merchant can add a fifth row
  without a deploy. Shopify keeps blocks in ONE flat ordered list, so each run
  filters the list by type and renders its own; reordering a `feature` past a
  `way` in the editor changes nothing, since the two never share a container.

  Numbering is derived from position in the filtered run, never stored. A stored
  number is a second source of truth that goes stale the moment a row is deleted
  from the middle.
{%- endcomment -%}

{{ 'bf-breadcrumb.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}
{{ 'bf-reveal.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}
{{ 'bf-main-about.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}
<script src="{{ 'bf-reveal.js' | asset_url }}" defer="defer"></script>
<script src="{{ 'bf-split-lines.js' | asset_url }}" defer="defer"></script>

{%- liquid
  assign features = section.blocks | where: 'type', 'feature'
  assign ways = section.blocks | where: 'type', 'way'
  assign details = section.blocks | where: 'type', 'detail'
-%}

<div class="about">
  {%- comment -%}
    The crumb is the PAGE's title, not the section's heading, because the board
    makes them differ on purpose: "About" in the trail, "About Bassface" as the
    title. Taking it from `page.title` also means the trail follows whatever the
    merchant renamed the page to, which is the thing a visitor navigating back
    up is looking for. Falls back to the heading if this template is ever
    rendered somewhere there is no page object.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  {%-
    render 'bf-breadcrumb',
    current: page.title | default: section.settings.heading,
    home_label: section.settings.breadcrumb_home,
    label: section.settings.breadcrumb_label
  -%}

  {%- comment -%}
    The entrance is the product page's and the bag's — <bf-reveal
    class="reveal reveal--rise"> clips a wrapper and climbs its single child out
    from under the top edge. It waits on the preloader handing over AND on
    reaching the viewport, so nothing plays behind a curtain that has not lifted.

    THE RESTING STATE IS THE VISIBLE ONE. Nothing here is hidden until
    bf-reveal.js adds `is-concealed`, so a blocked script leaves a plain readable
    page rather than a column of empty boxes. Every wrapper on this page obeys
    that, including the rules.

    --reveal-index is the stagger, one step per element within a group.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  <div class="about__header">
    <bf-reveal class="reveal reveal--rise">
      <h1 class="about__title">{{ section.settings.heading }}</h1>
    </bf-reveal>

    {%- if section.settings.description != blank -%}
      <bf-reveal class="reveal reveal--rise" style="--reveal-index: 1">
        <p class="about__intro">{{ section.settings.description }}</p>
      </bf-reveal>
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>

  {%- comment -%}
    The 88px statement between two 2px rules — the one moment on the page.

    <bf-split-lines> rewrites the paragraph into one <bf-reveal> per VISUAL line
    and hands the movement straight back to the machinery above, so the lines
    climb out one after another instead of the block arriving as a slab. It does
    nothing at all under reduced motion or without JavaScript, and the paragraph
    it starts as is the paragraph it ends as.

    The rules draw rather than rise: scaleX from the left, the hero's gesture for
    a rule being ruled instead of a bar being stretched.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  <div class="about__statement">
    <bf-reveal class="reveal about__draw">
      <hr class="about__rule about__rule--heavy">
    </bf-reveal>

    <bf-split-lines
      class="about__display"
      data-line-class="reveal--rise-display"
    >
      {{- section.settings.statement -}}
    </bf-split-lines>

    <bf-reveal class="reveal about__draw" style="--reveal-index: 1">
      <hr class="about__rule about__rule--heavy">
    </bf-reveal>
  </div>

  {%- comment -%} 01 — MISSION {%- endcomment -%}
  <section class="about__block">
    {%- render 'bf-about-head', number: '01', label: section.settings.mission_label -%}

    <div class="about__row about__row--mission">
      <div class="about__col">
        <bf-reveal class="reveal reveal--rise">
          <p class="about__quote">{{ section.settings.mission_quote }}</p>
        </bf-reveal>
      </div>

      <div class="about__col about__col--aside">
        <bf-reveal class="reveal reveal--rise" style="--reveal-index: 1">
          <p class="about__note">{{ section.settings.mission_note }}</p>
        </bf-reveal>
        <bf-reveal class="reveal reveal--rise" style="--reveal-index: 2">
          <p class="about__signature">{{ section.settings.mission_signature }}</p>
        </bf-reveal>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {%- comment -%} 02 — WHAT WE DO {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- if features.size > 0 -%}
    <section class="about__block">
      {%- render 'bf-about-head', number: '02', label: section.settings.features_label -%}

      <div class="about__row">
        <ul class="about__list">
          {%- for block in features -%}
            <li class="about__item" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
              <bf-reveal class="reveal reveal--rise" style="--reveal-index: {{ forloop.index0 }}">
                <div class="about__feature">
                  <span class="about__num" aria-hidden="true">
                    {%- render 'bf-about-number', position: forloop.index -%}
                  </span>
                  <h3 class="about__feature-title">{{ block.settings.title }}</h3>
                  <p class="about__feature-desc">{{ block.settings.description }}</p>
                </div>
              </bf-reveal>
            </li>
          {%- endfor -%}
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>
  {%- endif -%}

  {%- comment -%} 03 — SUPPORT THE COMEBACK {%- endcomment -%}
  <section class="about__block">
    {%- render 'bf-about-head', number: '03', label: section.settings.support_label -%}

    <div class="about__row about__row--support">
      <div class="about__col about__col--copy">
        <bf-reveal class="reveal reveal--rise">
          <h3 class="about__headline about__headline--strong">{{ section.settings.support_headline }}</h3>
        </bf-reveal>
        <bf-reveal class="reveal reveal--rise" style="--reveal-index: 1">
          <p class="about__note">{{ section.settings.support_body }}</p>
        </bf-reveal>
      </div>

      <div class="about__col">
        <ul class="about__list">
          {%- for block in ways -%}
            <li class="about__item" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
              <bf-reveal class="reveal reveal--rise" style="--reveal-index: {{ forloop.index0 }}">
                <div class="about__way">
                  <span class="about__num" aria-hidden="true">
                    {%- render 'bf-about-number', position: forloop.index -%}
                  </span>
                  <span class="about__way-label">{{ block.settings.label }}</span>
                </div>
              </bf-reveal>
            </li>
          {%- endfor -%}
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {%- comment -%} 04 — GET IN TOUCH {%- endcomment -%}
  <section class="about__block about__block--last">
    {%- render 'bf-about-head', number: '04', label: section.settings.contact_label -%}

    <div class="about__row about__row--contact">
      <div class="about__col about__col--copy">
        <bf-reveal class="reveal reveal--rise">
          <h3 class="about__headline">{{ section.settings.contact_headline }}</h3>
        </bf-reveal>

        {%- if section.settings.cta_label != blank -%}
          <bf-reveal class="reveal reveal--rise" style="--reveal-index: 1">
            {%- comment -%}
              22px against a 24px label, not the board's literal 20. The board's
              icon is an already-tightened path; ours is Lucide's stroke glyph in
              a 24 viewBox where the ink only spans 6 to 18, so a 20px box would
              draw a 10px arrow. See the arrow note in DESIGN-STATUS.

              TWO ARROWS, AND THE FIRST ONE IS THE POINT. This is the storefront's
              primary-link gesture, the one Add to Bag and Checkout already make:
              on hover the label and its arrow shift right by an arrow's width
              while a second arrow arrives from the left, and the link's own clip
              is what makes the pair read as ONE arrow crossing the label rather
              than two arrows appearing. Three links, one movement — the rules
              are bf-main-cart.css's, name for name.

              The lead arrow is aria-hidden and absolutely positioned, so it adds
              nothing to the accessible name and nothing to the link's width.
            {%- endcomment -%}
            <a class="about__cta" href="{{ section.settings.cta_url | default: routes.root_url }}">
              <span class="about__cta-icon about__cta-icon--lead" aria-hidden="true">
                {%- render 'bf-icon', icon: 'arrow-up-right', size: 22 -%}
              </span>
              <span class="about__cta-label">{{ section.settings.cta_label }}</span>
              <span class="about__cta-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                {%- render 'bf-icon', icon: 'arrow-up-right', size: 22 -%}
              </span>
            </a>
          </bf-reveal>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>

      <div class="about__col about__col--aside">
        <ul class="about__list">
          {%- for block in details -%}
            <li class="about__item" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
              <bf-reveal class="reveal reveal--rise" style="--reveal-index: {{ forloop.index0 }}">
                <div class="about__detail">
                  <span class="about__detail-key">{{ block.settings.label }}</span>

                  {%- if block.settings.url != blank -%}
                    <a class="about__detail-value about__link" href="{{ block.settings.url }}">
                      {{- block.settings.value -}}
                    </a>
                  {%- else -%}
                    <span class="about__detail-value">{{ block.settings.value }}</span>
                  {%- endif -%}
                </div>
              </bf-reveal>
            </li>
          {%- endfor -%}
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "About page",
  "tag": "section",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "heading",
      "label": "Page title",
      "default": "About Bassface"
    },
    {
      "type": "textarea",
      "id": "description",
      "label": "Intro paragraph",
      "default": "One stop for all EDM lovers. An independent project turned apparel label, built on the music we can't stop playing."
    },
    {
      "type": "textarea",
      "id": "statement",
      "label": "Display statement",
      "info": "The large line between two rules. Reveals one line at a time — keep it to two or three lines at desktop.",
      "default": "We started with the music. The apparel came after."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "breadcrumb_home",
      "label": "Breadcrumb home link",
      "default": "Home"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "breadcrumb_label",
      "label": "Breadcrumb landmark name",
      "info": "Read by screen readers to announce the navigation. Not shown.",
      "default": "Breadcrumb"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "01 — Mission"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "mission_label",
      "label": "Section label",
      "default": "MISSION"
    },
    {
      "type": "textarea",
      "id": "mission_quote",
      "label": "Mission statement",
      "default": "Keep Bassface a go-to place for discovering new EDM drops, hidden gems, and artist highlights — all delivered with consistency, honesty, and love for the music."
    },
    {
      "type": "textarea",
      "id": "mission_note",
      "label": "Side note",
      "default": "It started as a place to talk about the music. It turned into apparel you can wear to the show. Same obsession, different format."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "mission_signature",
      "label": "Signature",
      "default": "Bassface — since 2023"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "02 — What we do"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "features_label",
      "label": "Section label",
      "default": "WHAT WE DO"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Rows come from the \"What we do\" blocks below. They are numbered automatically in the order they appear."
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "03 — Support"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "support_label",
      "label": "Section label",
      "default": "SUPPORT THE COMEBACK"
    },
    {
      "type": "textarea",
      "id": "support_headline",
      "label": "Headline",
      "default": "Bassface has always been an independent passion project."
    },
    {
      "type": "textarea",
      "id": "support_body",
      "label": "Body",
      "default": "Every like, share, and message keeps this project alive."
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "04 — Get in touch"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "contact_label",
      "label": "Section label",
      "default": "GET IN TOUCH"
    },
    {
      "type": "textarea",
      "id": "contact_headline",
      "label": "Headline",
      "default": "Want to collaborate, send promos, or just say hi?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "cta_label",
      "label": "Link label",
      "info": "Leave blank to hide the link.",
      "default": "Contact us"
    },
    {
      "type": "url",
      "id": "cta_url",
      "label": "Link URL"
    }
  ],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "feature",
      "name": "What we do row",
      "settings": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "title",
          "label": "Title",
          "default": "Weekly picks"
        },
        {
          "type": "textarea",
          "id": "description",
          "label": "Description",
          "default": "The best new EDM releases, rounded up every week."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "way",
      "name": "Support way",
      "settings": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "label",
          "label": "Label",
          "default": "Share our posts and playlists"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "detail",
      "name": "Contact detail",
      "settings": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "label",
          "label": "Label",
          "default": "EMAIL"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "value",
          "label": "Value",
          "default": "hello@bassface.in"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "url",
          "label": "Link",
          "info": "A mailto:, tel: or https: URL. Leave blank to render the value as plain text."
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
